# D3-TH-006: Sublimation and boiling are different phase-change paths
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 dry_ice 1g @ -80C
add v2 liquid_nitrogen 1g @ -196C
measure v1 balance
measure v2 balance
look v1
look v2
heat v1 0.1kJ
heat v2 0.1kJ
measure v1 balance
measure v2 balance
look v1
look v2
particles v1
particles v2
inspect
